# Copy to `.env` for local development. Cloudflare Pages reads the same name
# from its build environment.
#
# The origin of the sync Worker (`worker/`, deployed with `pnpm sync:deploy`).
# Leave it unset and the app has no sync backend at all: no network code is
# reachable, the Settings page says so, and Sapling is the single-device app it
# has always been. That is the default, and a supported configuration.
#
# It has to be a build-time variable rather than a setting, because the module
# that needs it is the LiveStore leader worker, and a Web Worker has no
# localStorage to read one from. See `src/lib/sync/url.ts`.
#
# `pnpm sync:dev` serves the Worker at http://localhost:8787.
VITE_SYNC_URL=https://sapling-sync.vanoverloop.xyz
